ve time management and organizational skills. Comfortable speaking with individuals and groups in both in-person and virtual settings. Ability to lift and carry teaching materials and/or supplies weighing up to 45 pounds. Must be able to stand for extended periods of time indoors and outdoors while delivering lessons. Special Instructions to Applicants: In order to be considered, you must upload your cover letter, resume and references. This is a time-limited, grant funded position in EFNEP Hillsborough County Extension at 5339 County Road 579, Seffner, FL 33584 This position is eligible for veteran’s preference. If you are claiming veteran’s preference, please upload a copy of your DD 214 Member Copy 4 with your application for consideration. See our Veteran's Preference Page for more specific information. Application must be submitted by 11:55 p.m. (ET) of the posting end date. Health Assessment Required: No Advertised: 06 Oct 2026 Eastern Daylight Time Applications close: 28 Oct 2026 Eastern Daylight Time Back to search results Apply now Refer a friend Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App"
