    "https://explore.jobs.ufl.edu/en-us/job/541192/student-assistant-courier": {
      "title": "Student Assistant Courier",
      "description": "Student Assistant Courier Apply now Job no: 541192 Work type: Student Ast Location: Main Campus (Gainesville, FL) Categories: Facilities Operations/Skilled Trades, Office/Administrative/Fiscal Support, Transportation Services Department: 11030000 - RE-PERSONNEL SERVICES Classification Title: Student Assistant Courier Job Description: UF | Research's courier is responsible for the delivery and pick-up of documents and packages to and from various offices around campus. Additional duties include transport of boxes to and from Iron Mountain Storage Facility as needed, providing transportation in the state vehicle for employees and guests, and daily office maintenance tasks. UF | Research is the central office for administering contracts, grants, and subcontracts for the entire campus. Time-sensitive documents, letters, and checks are delivered on behalf of UF | Research's courier on a daily basis. Provided the nature of the documents sent and received by UF | Research, it is imperative that the utmost attention is given to the pick-up and delivery of these items at all times. Therefore, a high level of responsibility and good time-management skills are necessary for this position. Applicants must have a valid driver's license and an excellent driving record. Expected Salary: $15/hour Special Instructions to Applicants: This position is part-time Monday through Friday. Must be able to work over holiday breaks. In order to be considered, applicants must provide a cover letter, resume and a list of professional references. A criminal background check is required. Application must be submitted by 11:55 p.m. (ET) of the posting end date. This requisition has been reposted. Previous applicants are still under consideration and need not reapply. Health Assessment Required: No Advertised: 14 Oct 2026 Eastern Daylight Time Applications close: 28 Oct 2026 Eastern Daylight Time Back to search results Apply now Refer a friend Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email 