erbally and work with the public in a tactful and courteous manner. 4. Knowledge of grant process and accounting standards. 5 Ability to plan, organize and coordinate work assignments. 6. Ability to operate Windows-based and character-driven programs. 7. Knowledge of State, UF and College of Veterinary Medicine rules and procedures. 8. Certified Research Administrator Special Instructions to Applicants: In order to be considered, you must upload your cover letter, resume, and list of references. Application must be submitted by 11:55 p.m. (ET) of the posting end date. This is a time-limited position. Health Assessment Required: No Advertised: 22 Oct 2026 Eastern Daylight Time Applications close: 11 Nov 2026 Eastern Standard Time Back to search results Apply now Refer a friend Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App"
